Alphabet Inc.&#8216;s (NASDAQ:GOOGL) (NASDAQ:GOOG) Robotaxi service, Waymo, introduced a subscription tier for users, promising quicker pickup times and early access to service rollouts in new markets.



Waymo Premier



In a press release published on Thursday, the Robotaxi operator touted the &#8220;Waymo Premier&#8221; subscription tier, which is an &#8220;invite-only membership program&#8221;

